156	/// The audio group. Its six tick values — the two fades, the duck's and the
157	/// compressor's attack and release — are the one family the Times rule
158	/// deliberately leaves OFF the frame grid (core/CLAUDE.md): they are
159	/// envelope lengths sampled at the audio rate rather than positions in the
160	/// picture, and a 10 ms compressor attack quantised to a video frame would
161	/// round to nothing. Only the sign is checked, as it is for a motion
162	/// duration.
